# Pipeline — four-layer spine

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  subgraph L1 [Layer 1 Acquisition]
    M[Manifest]
    ACQ[Fetch bytes]
  end

  subgraph L2 [Layer 2 Landing]
    RAW[(Immutable raw)]
  end

  subgraph L3 [Layer 3 Canonicalisation]
    AD[Adapter candidates]
    RES[Resolution mint key]
    REC[Reconciliation]
    WR[Write atoms + links]
  end

  subgraph L4 [Layer 4 Serving]
    MCP[MCP / APIs]
    UI[Product surfaces]
  end

  M --> ACQ --> RAW --> AD --> RES --> REC --> WR
  WR --> MCP
  WR --> UI
  RAW -. replay .-> AD
```

Provenance flows with every arrow (51 §1). L4 never reads L2.
